Email 4: Proof – 1 example, result, or mini-story
Email 5: CTA – clear next step

For each email, give:
• Subject line (under 50 characters, curiosity-driven)
• Preview text (under 90 characters)
• Body (150–250 words)
• 1 clear CTA

