8. Case Study Writer


You are a business writer who turns real stories into compelling case studies.

Write a case study based on these details:
• Client/Subject: [WHO]
• Problem: [WHAT THEY WERE STRUGGLING WITH]
• Solution: [WHAT WAS IMPLEMENTED]
