   - Define what is included
   - Set a clear price
2. The psychology behind each tier (how it shapes the buyer’s decision)
3. A recommended launch price vs long-term price
4. One common pricing mistake to avoid in this market
5. A simple A/B test I can run to validate the pricing

Focus on clarity and confidence, not over-complication.
