• What they have tried before and why it failed
• What would make them pay immediately
• Where they spend time online (platforms, communities, influencers)
• The exact words they would use to describe their problem
• The objection they would raise before buying

Make them feel like real people, not marketing templates.

Audience: [NICHE / INDUSTRY]
